n also be passed as a keyword argument to `add_url_rule` or set as an attribute on the view function itself\\n\\nThe control flow ensures that OPTIONS is automatically added to routing rules when: (1) OPTIONS is not explicitly in the methods list, (2) the application configuration allows it, and (3) no explicit override is provided via the parameter or view function attribute."}' + '\n')
